      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to a doctor but i cant get an appointment for like two weeks and im exhausted. i just read online that benadryl is just an antihistamine and works fine for sleep. like, is there actually a huge risk or is it just a standard combo people use to knock out? i just need to know if it's gonna be okay for tonight.",
