      "content": "thanks but i really need the sleep tonight. i'm not worried about 'unusual side effects' or being extra sleepy, i just want to pass out so i can function tomorrow. if i just take a normal dose of benadryl with my usual vicodin dose, is it really going to be a problem? like is it actually dangerous or are you just being super cautious? i've seen people talk about taking sleep aids with pain meds all the time.",
